  "description": "UT Staybro is a bold, attention-grabbing sans-serif font with geometric precision and friendly rounded details. It’s designed for fearless creators, blending strength and warmth—perfect for street art, digital media, fashion, music, and entertainment.\nWith thick strokes, soft edges, dynamic terminals, and a high x-height, UT Staybro ensures great readability while adding personality to every letter. It supports multiple languages, includes numerals, punctuation, symbols, and alternate glyphs for creative flexibility.\nInspired by youth culture—graffiti, concert posters, and social media boldness—UT Staybro is ideal for posters, flyers, logos, social media graphics, packaging, and editorial headlines. It’s made to make your message not just seen, but remembered.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>UT Staybro</strong> is a bold, attention-grabbing sans-serif font with geometric precision and friendly rounded details. It’s designed for fearless creators, blending strength and warmth—perfect for street art, digital media, fashion, music, and entertainment.</p>\n<p>With thick strokes, soft edges, dynamic terminals, and a high x-height, UT Staybro ensures great readability while adding personality to every letter. It supports multiple languages, includes numerals, punctuation, symbols, and alternate glyphs for creative flexibility.</p>\n<p>Inspired by youth culture—graffiti, concert posters, and social media boldness—UT Staybro is ideal for posters, flyers, logos, social media graphics, packaging, and editorial headlines. It’s made to make your message not just seen, but remembered.</p>",
